Z||000000||Cheever2||02-04-2001||05:44 PM||||So, what do you think about the 1st week of XFL?  I was afraid I wouldn't be able to let my kids watch it, but I was wrong.  The only filth has been some of the commercials, at least the NBC broadcast last night.  I was right about the game itself: it is more "real" than NFL, IMO.  I like it better than NFL.  Just have to find out who these guys are and who's hot & who's not.  I love Jesse Ventura and Dick Butkus.  I also like the scramble that replaced the coin toss.  The other rule changes are good ideas too.<P>I should be watching the LA / SF game right now, but just finished doing my income tax form and found out I owe a lot of money, so I'm depressed.  Going to DQ for some condolences, IYKWIM (if you know what I mean).<BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||2
