Z||000007||Old Lar||02-04-2001||09:04 PM||||Too many cameras with views that were difficult to understand.  The continual shot from the overhead camera in back of the quarterback sucked.  It needed a wider angle lens.<P>Interviewing players after they run 40 yards for a touch down was a joke.  The players were out of breath and could't talk.<P>Half time in the locker room?<P>Thank god it did not have all the crap that the WWF has.<P>Cheerleaders and silicone right on.  Most of them were blonds too. duh  Lets have some more of the upward shots from the cheerleaders knee level. duh!<P>They need to improve the camera work.  The play was ok, no need to listen the the coaches play calling in code.  What's an 85 trapdog left along the thin line?  gibberish I don't need.<P>Out in one season.||||reg||13
